WEBVTT

00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:15,760
Curious if the mud wig protocol is valuable, or how do you do it if you are restricting

00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,760
daring?

00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:20,240
We've got this question a lot.

00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:25,480
I think the mud wig protocol can be valuable, but I have some people doing the mud wig

00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,480
protocol because it tested on them with cheek swab test.

00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:33,560
But can you do the mud wig protocol if you're not supposed to be taking dairy?

00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:37,800
And my answer to that is no, you can't do the mud wig protocol if you're restricting

00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,800
daring.

00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:51,640
Now, if on your cheek swab test, I just put limit dairy, then we should have a specific

00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:57,480
conversation whether I think that would be okay for you to do if you feel led to do that.

00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:04,760
But if on your cheek swab test it says no dairy, then I would say let's not do the mud wig

00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,760
protocol right there.

00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:11,080
Now, if you talked to mud wig, I've said this before, if you went on their website, it

00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:15,280
says that the oil changes the dairy.

00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:22,120
There is it's a magical thing that goes on when you add a flaxseed oil to dairy and blend

00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,120
it up.

00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:27,720
It still has the qualities of stimulating growth.

00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:34,480
It still has IGF1, it still stimulates the pathways that could stimulate growth.

00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:39,160
So I would say no, it doesn't make those changes.

